    {
      "title": "Decorative Seams",
      "slug": "decorative-seams",
      "displayOrder": 25,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 64,
        "lessonOrder": 25
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "video",
              "vimeoId": "151856969",
              "title": "Hairpin Lace Seam",
              "legacyComponentId": 758,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "Hairpin Lace Seam",
          "slug": "hairpin-lace-seam",
          "order": 1,
          "legacy": {
            "assignId": 250,
            "blockType": "Video"
          }
        },
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Follow the video to create 2 swatches that you will join with a hairpin seam.  It is helpful to use a contrasting color for each swatch, making it easier to work the join until you get the hang of it.<br><blockquote class=\"smallblock\"><small>Stitches and rows shown are for standard machine <em>(Mid-gauge/bulky)</em></small></blockquote>\r\n\r\n<b>Swatch 1:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cast on 60 <em>(30)</em> needles</li>\r\n<Li>On the RIGHT side, leave a needle out of work as indicated in the video<br>\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/2/not_enough_needles/left.png\">\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br><b>Swatch 2:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Cast on 60 <em>(30)</em> needles, on the LEFT side, leave a needle out of work as indicated in the video<br>\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/2/not_enough_needles/right.png\">\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nJoin the swatches following the video taking care to catch all strands and secure the stitches at the end.\r\n<br>\r\nDoes your swatch look like ours?<br>\r\n<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/2/not_enough_needles/hairpin_intro.jpg\"><br>\r\n\r\n<b>TIP:</b><br>Use this join to create belts and straps.  Knit a single piece, leaving a needle out of work on each edge.  Fold the band in half and work the Hairpin Lace technique to join.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"/challenge/images/v2/2/not_enough_needles/belt.jpg\">",
              "legacyComponentId": 783,
              "order": 1
            },
            {
              "type": "migrationPending",
              "legacyType": "ImageUpload",
              "notes": [
                "Unmapped legacy component type: ImageUpload"
              ],
              "legacyFields": {
