        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "Following the instruction in the video, practice the Twisted Join technique yourself.<br>\r\nIt knits up quickly and is easier than the Hairpin Lace technique.  The join has a cable appearance that is attractive when both pieces are knit in the same color or in contrasting colors.",
